## Work tracking (TAOS)

Work in this repository is tracked by an operating layer at:

```
{{taos_home}}
```

Before starting anything non-trivial here:

```bash
{{taos_home}}/taos status --compact
{{taos_home}}/taos start --agent <codex|claude> --task {{prefix}}-N --session "{{prefix}}-N | short label"
```

Read `{{taos_home}}/AGENTS.md` for the full contract: claims, handoffs,
decisions, and the hard stops. Two agents share this repo, so check
`taos claim check` before writing in an area another agent may hold.
